==================== README (src/c/bp4prism) =====================

This directory contains a minimal set of C source and binary files
from B-Prolog, required to build the PRISM system:

  include/  ... header files from B-Prolog
  lib/      ... static libraries of B-Prolog on various platforms

Native MinGW builds use the same include/ directory and these archives:

  lib/bp4prism-mingw32.a  ... Windows x86
  lib/bp4prism-mingw64.a  ... Windows x64

Build with PRISM_MINGW=1 and PRISM_MINGW_BITS=32 or 64 (default: 64).
The shared headers keep MinGW changes conditional on PRISM_MINGW=1;
existing platform branches and archives are retained. Normal builds copy
only the matching archive from bp4prism/Emulator.prism into lib/.
Do not overwrite these version-controlled public headers with emulator
headers. See ../../../tools/README_mingw.md or the build and header-update procedures.
